  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。滿懷熱情製作。眾多適用於 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">暗影坐騎（Shadow Mounts）是專為 SpookyJam 2024 製作的模組，新增了暗影鞍（Shadow Saddle）物品。這個獨特的鞍具可以裝備在任何馬匹上，將其變為暗影形態。紋理會變暗，標記則會呈現靈魂火藍色。騎乘時會顯示粒子效果！<br><br>目前效果純屬視覺特效，但未來我計劃新增更多功能。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>darkenHorseTexture</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">設定是否在裝備暗影鞍時使馬匹紋理變暗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showShadowHorseParticles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">設定是否顯示暗影坐騎的粒子效果。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyShowParticlesWhenRiding</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，僅在玩家騎乘時顯示暗影坐騎的粒子效果。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>製作暗影鞍的配方：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/shadow-mounts/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>暗影坐騎會產生特殊的粒子效果：<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">靜止時有些許粒子，移動時則大量湧現！</span></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/shadow-mounts/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>這個新鞍具能將任何馬匹轉變為暗影變體：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/shadow-mounts/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用本模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多的模組頁面上逐一追蹤留言。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事宜，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
